{"availability":"available","full":"dguywhoknows/meeting-notes-analyzer","name":"meeting-notes-analyzer","description":"Turn a meeting transcript into minutes, decisions and owned action items, plus speaker analytics: talk time, interruptions, balance and a timeline.","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T04:13:39Z","updated":"2026-10-10T03:50:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dguywhoknows.github.io/meeting-notes-analyzer/","topics":["github-pages","javascript","meetings","productivity","transcripts"],"demo":"https://dguywhoknows.github.io/meeting-notes-analyzer/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.322Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.322Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.322Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.322Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Turn a meeting transcript into minutes, decisions and owned action items, plus speaker analytics: talk time, interruptions, balance and a timeline.","Paste a transcript or drop in a Zoom/Teams WebVTT or SRT file. A tolerant parser handles timestamps, multi-line turns and tags, and estimates timing from speaking rate when timestamps are missing. Local analytics show how the meeting actually went: a speaker-lane timeline, talk share, a Gini balance score, turn lengths, questions asked, interruptions (who cut off whom) and filler words. The AI then writes grounded minutes: summary, decisions with supporting quotes, action items with owner and due date exactly as stated, open questions, risks and the next agenda. It can also draft the…"],"features":["Transcript parser: plain 'Name: text', [hh:mm:ss] stamps, WebVTT/SRT with voice tags","Speaker timeline lanes, talk-share bars, Gini-coefficient balance indicator","Dynamics table: turns, avg/longest turn, questions, interruptions given/received, filler words","AI minutes grounded with quotes; never invents owners or dates","Checkable action items; export Markdown minutes + CSV action items"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/meeting-notes-analyzer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"de386a071d2649e87d12dfa20068b731934541e22023c6ab3321e8efcba27dfd","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.397Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.397Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Turn a meeting transcript into minutes, decisions and owned action items, plus speaker analytics: talk time, interruptions, balance and a timeline.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/meeting-notes-analyzer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"index.html is the public home page, login.html handles accounts and app.html is the app.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/meeting-notes-analyzer/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"de386a071d2649e87d12dfa20068b731934541e22023c6ab3321e8efcba27dfd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/meeting-notes-analyzer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.398Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T03:50:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/meeting-notes-analyzer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.398Z","hash":"de386a071d2649e87d12dfa20068b731934541e22023c6ab3321e8efcba27dfd","originalBytes":5487,"storedBytes":5487,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["src","page","app","minutes","every","lib","tests","action","items","meeting","settings","balance","browser","decisions","follow-up","key","questions","quotes","runs","search","speaker","transcript","accounts","across","analytics","core.js","date","email","export","extraction","functions","generated","index.html","interruptions","markdown","meetings","model","next","open","owner","parsing","participation","provider","saved","srt","styles","supporting","talk","timeline","turn","turns","unit","webvtt","acti